	(text "Local trips, latched until EN low (no firmware): transformer OC +211/-210 A (0.78 us), |I_dc| 5.0 A (tau 1 ms), port OV 986 / 937 V (37 us), +24V UV, driver UVLO; DESAT gates all PWMs of its bridge. FLT reports all, also with EN low; RDY is driven."
