	(text "AN1 = 5.005 mV/A on 1.44 V CM (AMC3330, 0.2 ohm). Domains: PELV, HV1, HV2, PE + 8 gate drivers. Isolators: UCC21710, UCC14241-Q1, UCC12050, AMC3330, ISO7720F, transformer, port AMC/TPSI, contactors."
