	(text "Fail-safe off: received pairs biased 470R/120R/470R -> undriven VID <= -0.29 V (receiver -0.2 V) = LOW = off; no 3.3 V -> UCC14241 ENA low, PWM/EN pulled low; +24V_GD below 19.7 V -> EN_DRV and PWM forced low before the bias UVLO."
